            "sha256": "9f2280eba18a7b8931bf1c4a6f32170b253a8c1dc404e0abbf5d6dfb4d230253"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "assets/book-images/074/page-0742-Im458.jpg",
          "alt": "上证指数一分钟走势图，显示连续盘中波动、5081.45 点位，并附 MACD",
          "caption": "上证指数一分钟走势与 5081.45 点位",
          "source": {
            "page": 742,
            "top": 77.6,
            "bottom": 394.1,
            "sha256": "cd62f83744ed0ee7ea1c087866ce884044973ba560a656bb9ca5deb1a9a5a8d9"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "最近整天下午晚上都泡在北京那几个高新园区那里看项目、谈项目，有点忙，不能和各位聊天了。先下，再见",
          "source": {
            "start": {
              "page": 742,
              "top": 401.4
            },
            "end": {
              "page": 742,
              "top": 429.0
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "image",
          "src": "assets/book-images/074/page-0742-Im459.jpg",
          "alt": "上证指数一分钟走势图，标注 38 至 72 的分段序号、4646.88 与 5209.19 点位，并附成交量和 MACD",
          "caption": "上证指数一分钟走势：38 至 72 段与 MACD",
          "source": {
            "page": 742,
            "top": 443.0,
            "bottom": 754.7,
            "sha256": "a2deadb221ed272d7d9a59fbd5ddd32d6b014b461404e8b319de18d03a799be3"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "sourceCorrections": [
